# xcheck v1 topology: STM32MP257F-DK (ST LTDC, driver stm), hand-written.
#
# Source:  docs/platform-capabilities.md (probe block and raw plane table), observed 2026-11-28.
#          Constraint lines come from docs/stm32mp257-ltdc-board.md, docs/stm32mp257-ltdc-source-full.md
#          and docs/stm32mp257-ltdc-sync-source.md (read only).
# Commit:  eab4162 (HEAD when written).
# Date:    2026-11-28.
# Claim:   recorded input only. This file makes NO hardware claim; results computed from it are
#          portability / cross-check evidence, labelled with the origin line below.
# Frames:  none. No board addresses, hostnames, serials or credentials.
#
# Tags in the constraint comments are the tags of the cited doc row: 'read from source', 'inferred',
# or 'observed <date>' (a TEST_ONLY probe on the board, recorded in the doc).
xcheck 1
origin observed 2026-11-28 stm32mp257-topology.md at commit eab4162; constraints read from stm32mp257-ltdc-*.md
profile generic

# One CRTC 41 (1920x1080 @ 60.000 Hz); all three planes reach it (outputs mask 0x1).
output 41 1920 1080 60000

# zpos is a mutable range 0..2 on all three planes (observed 2026-11-28, modetest -p).
# zpos_now = the dump's current value: the debugfs state before the run shows normalized-zpos 0/1/2 for
# planes 34/42/49 (observed 2026-11-28). It equals the plane index and the property table's 'default'
# column (0, 1, 2), so both readings agree.
# blend=premul: the planes have no 'pixel blend mode' property; the probe's [premultiplied] is filled in by
# composition-drm (inferred, per the topology doc's note 1), not observed.
# Scaling (LTDC docs): layers 34 and 42 scale, layer 49 does not.
#   - Upscale only, no downscale, no YUV scaling: read from source (ltdc-source-full.md, 'Scaler limits'
#     and 'Scaling checks', ltdc.c:1585-1602). Hence down:0x10000 (factor 1.0).
#   - Which layers have the scaler is a register value, not in source (ltdc-source-full.md); the layer
#     split is observed 2026-11-27 (ltdc-board.md, 'Scaling bounds': TEST_ONLY upscale accepted on 34 and
#     42, rejected above 1.0 on 49) and 'scales / has no scaler' is inferred there.
#   - No upper upscale factor was found: 34 and 42 accepted every factor up to the probe ladder's top
#     (32x, not a limit) and the code has no cap (ltdc-source-full.md). up:0xffffffff stands for 'no cap
#     found', not for a measured limit.
# max_source=none: STM_MAX_FB_WIDTH/HEIGHT 2048 (drv.c:35-36, read from source, ltdc-source-full.md) limit
#   the DRM framebuffer, not a plane's source rectangle; that doc lists it as 'consistent with leaving
#   max_source unset'.
# full_output=0: no doc states a full-output-only rule for any layer. Observed 2026-11-27 (ltdc-board.md,
#   'Scaling bounds'): plane 34 accepted a partial destination rectangle.
# group: none. No doc states a shared scaler, fetch unit or other shared resource across layers (layers
#   reload per layer on this IP, ltdc-sync-source.md, read from source / inferred); no group line is written.
# C8: the raw planes advertise C8 (palette); the probe prints 'C8??' because the engine does not map it.
#   It is not written as a format line ('C8' is not a 4-character fourcc token). Each plane's list is
#   therefore one entry shorter than the probe's count (21/25/17); xc-convert decides how to carry it.

# Layer 0. Rotation rot0/90/180/270 + reflect-x/y (observed 2026-11-28, property table).
plane 34 kind=primary outputs=0x1 zpos=0..2 zpos_now=0 alpha=1 blend=premul transforms=normal,rot90,rot180,rot270,flip_h,flip_v scaling=up:0xffffffff/down:0x10000 max_source=none full_output=0
  format AR24 0x0
  format XR24 0x0
  format AB24 0x0
  format XB24 0x0
  format RA24 0x0
  format RX24 0x0
  format BA24 0x0
  format BX24 0x0
  format RG16 0x0
  format BG16 0x0
  format RG24 0x0
  format BG24 0x0
  format AR15 0x0
  format XR15 0x0
  format AR12 0x0
  format XR12 0x0
  format YUYV 0x0
  format YVYU 0x0
  format UYVY 0x0
  format VYUY 0x0

# Layer 1. Rotation rot0 + reflect-x/y only (observed 2026-11-28). Only plane with YUV 4:2:0.
plane 42 kind=overlay outputs=0x1 zpos=0..2 zpos_now=1 alpha=1 blend=premul transforms=normal,flip_h,flip_v scaling=up:0xffffffff/down:0x10000 max_source=none full_output=0
  format AR24 0x0
  format XR24 0x0
  format AB24 0x0
  format XB24 0x0
  format RA24 0x0
  format RX24 0x0
  format BA24 0x0
  format BX24 0x0
  format RG16 0x0
  format BG16 0x0
  format RG24 0x0
  format BG24 0x0
  format AR15 0x0
  format XR15 0x0
  format AR12 0x0
  format XR12 0x0
  format YUYV 0x0
  format YVYU 0x0
  format UYVY 0x0
  format VYUY 0x0
  format NV12 0x0
  format NV21 0x0
  format YU12 0x0
  format YV12 0x0

# Layer 2. Rotation rot0 + reflect-x/y only (observed 2026-11-28). No YUV.
# scaling=none: no scaler (inferred, ltdc-board.md; upscale above 1.0 rejected, observed 2026-11-27;
# without the ability any size mismatch is rejected, read from source, ltdc.c:1585-1602).
plane 49 kind=overlay outputs=0x1 zpos=0..2 zpos_now=2 alpha=1 blend=premul transforms=normal,flip_h,flip_v scaling=none max_source=none full_output=0
  format AR24 0x0
  format XR24 0x0
